WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.841
The cookie banner said Reject All.

2
00:00:02.841 --> 00:00:04.807
The trackers loaded anyway.

3
00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:10.045
Analytics and sales trackers ran before consent,

4
00:00:10.045 --> 00:00:12.395
and again after Reject All.

5
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.508
The client blamed load order.

6
00:00:15.508 --> 00:00:17.031
I tested that first:

7
00:00:17.031 --> 00:00:21.676
our script already loaded first, so the gap had to be timing.

8
00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:27.743
Now the script holds known trackers and tells Google denied the moment it runs,

9
00:00:27.743 --> 00:00:30.823
and it fails closed if its settings can't load.

10
00:00:31.733 --> 00:00:33.555
Trackers wait for a choice,

11
00:00:33.555 --> 00:00:37.469
and a slow-network test with twenty-four checks guards it.

